---Start a setup run
---
---Start the setup agent in the cloud on a GitHub repository of this project. It adds PostHog to the code and opens a pull request. Each user can have one setup run active per project at a time.
---
---`POST /api/projects/{project_id}/wizard/installs/`
---Errors: BadRequest, Forbidden, NotFound, Conflict.
---@param input posthog.wizard.CreateWizardInstallRequest
---@return posthog.wizard.WizardInstallStart? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:create_wizard_install(input) end

